            "review_title": "Review at Mu Sa Ka Riem Halal Restaurant",
            "review_text": "TheBarkingOwl\nNhulunbuy, Australia58 contributions\n0\nPossibly ordered the wrong dishes\nMay 2016 • Family\nWent here looking for a change from the great Vietnamese food we have been eating for the last few weeks. Unfortunately we were disappointed we did. Selecting some standard fried chicken for the children and a satay dish for us were both very disappointing, especially the fried chicken which came out dry and unpalatable. We did order two vegetable dishes which were both nice, but overall a disappointment. The restaurant was very busy and maybe if we ordered other foods it might have been OK.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 23, 2016",
